{"id":"72d50169a31e1436","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-indexed-product.md","title":"Indexed Product (Generalized Product)","display":"df-indexed-product — Indexed Product (Generalized Product)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-indexed-product","aliases":["58-df-indexed-product","58-df-generalized-product"],"display":"df-indexed-product — Indexed Product (Generalized Product)","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-indexed-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-indexed-product</span><span>58-df-generalized-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-indexed-product — Indexed Product (Generalized Product)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,U,A\\in V\">\\(I,U,A\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,U)\\)</span> (set-indexed family, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\coloneqq A(i)\">\\(A_i\\coloneqq A(i)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span> (component notation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;A,I,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;A,I,U)\\)</span> (product-set relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;A,I,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,U)\\land P=\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal P\\!\\left(I\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\right):\\mathrm{Function}\\left(f,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\right)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in A(i))\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;A,I,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,U)\\land P=\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal P\\!\\left(I\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\right):\\mathrm{Function}\\left(f,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\right)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in A(i))\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Standard notation</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i\">\\(\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i\\)</span> (also written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{i \\in I} A_i\">\\(\\Pi_{i \\in I} A_i\\)</span>)</li>\n<li>The product set is an explicit output argument <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>; the definition is not a conditional assignment to an undeclared global term.</li>\n<li><strong>Empty index set</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i \\in \\emptyset} A_i = \\{\\emptyset_{\\emptyset}\\}\">\\(\\prod_{i \\in \\emptyset} A_i = \\{\\emptyset_{\\emptyset}\\}\\)</span> (the unique function from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\">\\(\\emptyset\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><strong>Choice function</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i\">\\(\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i\\)</span> 的元素称为选择函数</li>\n<li><strong>Constant family</strong>: 若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i = A\">\\(A_i = A\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i = {}^I A\">\\(\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i = {}^I A\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ddc0c5d640e9ab2\" href=\"?note=3ddc0c5d640e9ab2\" title=\"58-df-function-space\">58-df-function-space</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>Projection</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_j : \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i \\to A_j\">\\(\\pi_j : \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i \\to A_j\\)</span> defined as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_j(f) = f(j)\">\\(\\pi_j(f) = f(j)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I,U,A\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,U)$ (set-indexed family, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function-space","status":"resolved","id":"3ddc0c5d640e9ab2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"**Constant family**: 若所有 $A_i = A$，则 $\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i = {}^I A$ (see [[58-df-function-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,U,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,U)","display":false},{"tex":"A_i\\coloneqq A(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;A,I,U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;A,I,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,U)\\land P=\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal P\\!\\left(I\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\right):\\mathrm{Function}\\left(f,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\right)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in A(i))\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{i \\in I} A_i","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i \\in \\emptyset} A_i = \\{\\emptyset_{\\emptyset}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i","display":false},{"tex":"A_i = A","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i = {}^I A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_j : \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i \\to A_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_j(f) = f(j)","display":false}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce4025d134acee55","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)$ (choice functions, see [[58-df-indexed-product]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-indexed-product]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-672","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-indexed-product.md|58-df-indexed-product]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","3ddc0c5d640e9ab2"]}